17
00:02:13,219 --> 00:02:21,259
[Slow] 政府は、今年の文化勲章を8人に贈ると発表しました。

18
00:02:22,060 --> 00:02:26,788
[Host] The government announced it will give this year's Order of Culture to eight people.

